t` and `--no-default-features`, under **debug and release** (`panic = \"abort\"`): `PROFILES=\"debug release\" ./verify.sh` → **ALL CONFIGURATIONS PASSED**, symbol parity confirmed for both profiles. Mutation tests (table entry, `tolower` entry, SIGPIPE fix) each produce failures, confirming the suite detects regressions.","ttft_ms":2433,"ttft_stream_ms":2252,"time_to_request_ms":50,"type":"result","duration_ms":1424122,"uuid":"d0168a3f-a46c-4bab-9d40-764d7d09d59c"}
